null,"sender":"them","time":"10:23","timestamp":1778552613424,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7884},{"id":1778551801590,"text":"你只知道，当你再次恢复意识时，你的后背正紧紧地贴着冰冷的落地窗玻璃。","rawContent":"你只知道，当你再次恢复意识时，你的后背正紧紧地贴着冰冷的落地窗玻璃。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:23","timestamp":1778552617954,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7885},{"id":1778551801591,"text":"“第四个，落地窗。”","rawContent":"“第四个，落地窗。”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:23","timestamp":1778552620445,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7886},{"id":1778551801592,"text":"陆驰的声音，像催命的符咒。","rawContent":"陆驰的声音，像催命的符咒。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:23","timestamp":1778552623203,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7887},{"id":1778551801593,"text":"你浑身都在抖，抖得像秋风里的落叶。","rawContent":"你浑身都在抖，抖得像秋风里的落叶。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:23","timestamp":1778552626413,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e13jn","characterId":"e005ad20-6483-4398-97f5-8088200867c3","_id":7888},{"id":1778551801594,"text":"“不要了……陆驰……我真的不行了……”你哭着求他，“我腿软……站不住……”","rawContent":"“不要了……陆驰……我真的不行了……”你哭着求他，“我腿软……站不住……”","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"10:23","timestamp":1778552630943,"roundId":"round_1778551818210_9djmtt76q","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1775896106705_evl3e